        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lorde\n- Songs: \"Tennis Court\", \"Royals\"\n- Albums and EPs: \"Pure Heroine\", \"The Love Club EP\"\n- Companies: Universal Music Group\n\nFacts:\n- In 2012, Lorde released \"Royals\" on her debut EP \"The Love Club EP\".\n- On 7 June 2013, Universal Music Group released \"Tennis Court\" as the second single from \"Pure Heroine\", following \"Royals\".\n- In 2013, Lorde included \"Royals\" on her debut studio album \"Pure Heroine\".",
